## 내 풀이
```java
class Solution {
    public String solution(String rsp) {
        String answer = "";
        for (int i = 0; i < rsp.length(); i++) {
            if (rsp.charAt(i) == '0') answer += "5";
            else if (rsp.charAt(i) == '2') answer += "0";
            else if (rsp.charAt(i) == '5') answer += "2";
            
        }
        return answer;
    }
}
```

